      "name": "Identification Knack",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Shevala has long studied magical items and their properties, becoming something of a local legend for her ability to figure out how obscure magical items function. When she uses the Identify Magic activity to examine a magic item, she only needs 1 minute to perform the activity, and she gains a +2 circumstance bonus on the check."
    },
