      ],
      "text": "If Shevala's next action is to Cast a Spell that has a range, increase that spell's range by 30 feet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Signature Spells",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Shevala can freely heighten the following spells rather than having to learn higher rank versions of them separately: breathe fire, dispel magic, fireball, and wall of fire."
